  "description": "*\"I don't need permission. I'm looking for a husband, not my brother or my father's husband.\"*\n\nNatalie Ailesden was the most beautiful and dangerous thorny woman in the empire. I possessed her, the main character in the reverse harem game. I thought I could clear it quickly because it's a familiar game...\n\n*\"Did you clean up all the other women?\"*\n\nThe flirtatious prince, Amon Luxor. Route completed; \"I thought I had a purpose for my energy.\" The cold grand duke of the north, Roger Crawford. Route completed;\n\n*\"I taught you that if you cling to it while crying, you can have a woman's heart...\"*\n\nThe crying psychopath mage, Igor. Route completed. I've captured all the male leads, but why hasn't the ending appeared?!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
